    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点2: 卷积的微积分性质",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            431,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/9602d1c8cd4c29bb604f3a535e4fd9f45f005a99e8676d3c3d53134af086d5e9.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "sub_type": "seal",
        "bbox": [
            401,
            28,
            601,
            155
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "公众号：通信考研小马哥 希望出现δ相关 尽可能修改δ",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            608,
            53,
            838,
            143
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、微分性质：",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            135,
            297,
            157
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "两个函数卷积后的导数等于其中一函数的导数与另一函数的卷积，其表示式为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            162,
            800,
            178
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d}{d t} \\left[ f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) \\right] = f _ {1} (t) * \\frac {d f _ {2} (t)}{d t} = \\frac {d f _ {1} (t)}{d t} * f _ {2} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            282,
            181,
            694,
            223
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由卷积定义可证明此关系式",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            223,
            408,
            238
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\frac {d}{d t} [ f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t) ] = \\frac {d}{d t} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) f _ {2} (t - \\tau) d \\tau} & {= \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) \\frac {d f _ {2} (t - \\tau)}{d t} d \\tau} \\\\ & {= f _ {1} (t) * \\frac {d f _ {2} (t)}{d t}} \\\\ & {= \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) \\frac {d f _ {2} (t - \\tau)}{d (t - \\tau)} d \\tau} \\\\ {\\mathrm{积分性质}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            203,
            237,
            885,
            346
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "两函数卷积后的积分等于其中一函数之积分与另一函数之卷积。其表示式为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            347,
            781,
            364
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/37e4d58b60d9dbd57d1861adb2a8de83b6328aaf0bffa0567147a996547f0141.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "sub_type": "seal",
        "bbox": [
            80,
            374,
            149,
            421
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {\\underset {- \\infty} {\\overset {t} {\\int_ {- \\infty}} [ f _ {1} (\\lambda) * f _ {2} (\\lambda) ] d \\lambda} = f _ {1} (t) * \\underset {- \\infty} {\\overset {t} {\\int_ {- \\infty}} f _ {2} (\\lambda) d \\lambda} = f _ {2} (t) * \\underset {- \\infty} {\\overset {t} {\\int_ {- \\infty}} f _ {1} (\\lambda) d \\lambda}} \\\\ & {\\text {证明如下}} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\mathrm{d} \\lambda} \\\\ & {\\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\qquad \\mathrm{d} \\lambda} \\\\ & {\\qquad =  \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} [ f _ {1} (\\lambda) * f _ {2} (\\lambda) ] d \\lambda =  \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t}   \\left[  \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau) f _ {2} (\\lambda - \\tau) d \\tau   \\right] d \\lambda} \\\\ & {\\qquad =   \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {\\infty} f _ {1} (\\tau)   \\left[   \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {2} (\\lambda - \\tau) d \\lambda   \\right] d \\tau = f _ {1} (t) *   \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {2} (\\lambda) d \\lambda} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            370,
            769,
            515
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、重点应用",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            521,
            290,
            536
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设 $s(t)=[f_{1}(t)*f_{2}(t)]$ ，则有",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            545,
            423,
            562
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ns ^ {(i)} (t) = f _ {1} ^ {(j)} (t) * f _ {2} ^ {(i - j)} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            389,
            568,
            603,
            590
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "此处，当 $i, j$ 取正整数时为导数的阶次，取负整数时为重积分的次数。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            598,
            731,
            614
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一个简单的例子是",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            622,
            334,
            638
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d f _ {1} (t)}{d t} * \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} f _ {2} (\\lambda) d \\lambda = f _ {1} (t) * f _ {2} (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            644,
            643,
            680
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】在运用上式求解时必须注意 $f_{1}(t)$ 和 $f_{2}(t)$ 应满足时间受限条件，当 $t\\to-\\infty$ 时函数值应等于零。",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            686,
            803,
            730
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "page_number",
        "text": "5",
        "bbox": [
