    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点3：卷积微积分图解法",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            440,
            127
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "卷积微积分图解法 $\\Leftrightarrow f(t)=f_{1}^{\\prime}(t)*f_{2}^{(-1)}(t)=f_{1}^{(-1)}(t)*f_{2}^{\\prime}(t)$ ，求导时选择可以出现δ的信号且数量少的\n\n例 46：已知 $f(t)$ 和 $h(t)$ ，求 $g(t)=f(t)*h(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            135,
            815,
            207
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/108b84187eb7c7c37e761950bd1609c14bc6d2d694dca4f0b42e222f4f886b0b.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            72,
            203,
            223,
            318
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/48e9902ea0698b83b59e56fd6baf5cef3e11527cd466d0db872407be5fca9e99.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            221,
            217,
            492,
            324
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/b9efcd1a77ed2bfed157c8f055cabefd6d9824db0226ffc362063cd9ead178e5.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            522,
            218,
            667,
            327
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/a0957a30785d51c6bb5ebbcba7786c14b78d6934ff91141a78623a099fda639b.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            670,
            191,
            907,
            328
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {g (t)} & {= [ \\sqrt {(t)} - \\sqrt {(t - 1)} ] * f ^ {(t)}} \\\\ & {= f ^ {(t)} - f ^ {(t - 1)} (t - 1)} \\\\ & {\\mathrm{例47:已知} h (t), \\mathrm{求} g (t) = h (t) * h (t).} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            99,
            324,
            504,
            394
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{若}} & {g (t) = f ^ {\\prime} (t) * h ^ {(t)}} \\\\ & {= \\left[ \\sqrt [ 3 ]{(t)} - 2 \\sqrt [ 3 ]{(t - 1)} + \\sqrt [ 3 ]{(t - 2)} \\right] * \\binom {(- 1)} {h (t)}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            526,
            332,
            910,
            407
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{解:}} & {g (t) = h ^ {(1)} (t) * h ^ {(1 - 1)} (t)} \\\\ & {= A \\left[ \\sqrt {1 + 1} - \\delta (t - 1) \\right] * h ^ {(1)} (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            421,
            413,
            530
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/aa3a3d6cbc169b730517bc1eb1fdee41e72358f6b715aa6d215aea1fbebeacd2.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            411,
            399,
            564,
            505
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/28d981d5ec63cfc73449be0cb9f6e4c050de218a9cd4c29749e13bdb0110bba2.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
