    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 48: 已知 $f(t)$ 和 $h(t)$ 如下图所示，求 $g(t) = f(t) * h(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            108,
            638,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/9e2505edd3321db8a6a31634836f307188f2cab82a655921f3d1d3251c3b3532.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            63,
            131,
            878,
            397
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】结论1：卷积后信号的宽度与范围",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            429,
            584,
            447
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "n+1，n+大",
        "bbox": [
            682,
            438,
            813,
            456
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设 $f_{1}(t)$ 范围为 $[t_{1},t_{2}]$ ， $f_{2}(t)$ 范围为 $[t_{3},t_{4}]$ ，则 $f_{1}(t)*f_{2}(t)$ 范围为 $[t_{1}+t_{3},t_{2}+t_{4}]$ 宽度为两者宽度之和。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            454,
            813,
            498
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】结论2：两个矩形的卷积结论",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            505,
            549,
            523
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "宽度相等，卷积结果为等腰三角形；宽度不等，卷积结果为等腰梯形。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            530,
            737,
            548
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/76dcad331eccb6a0188e2e184a7bd7c8ef967cd13594a18c2176cb533ee9422e.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            265,
            555,
            736,
            676
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
